  "full_text": "So, monks don't have to go to communion because they're priests, right? The best religion is the one with the most new vistas of understanding over a lifetime. So maybe I'll go to communion and have a family. And then maybe I'll understand. Something like that. Something new. A new vista of understanding. So, yeah, I'm not really good at my own family. But I'm good around God. And that's good. That's more important, right? But God doesn't like two-faced. For you say, where is the house of the prince? And where are the dwelling places of the wicked? Have you not asked them that go by the way? And do you not know their tokens? That the wicked is reserved to the day of destruction. They shall be brought forth to the day of wrath. You shall declare his way to his face. And you shall repay him. Oh, tokens. Oh, tokens. tokens. What he hath done, yet he shall, you remember arcade tokens, yet he shall be brought to the grave and shall remain in the tomb. Yet he shall be brought to the grave and shall remain in the tomb. The clouds of the valley shall be sweet unto him, and every man shall draw after him, as there are an immovable before him. How then comfort ye me in vain, seeing in your answer that remains falsehood? I went through a lot of stages of spirit. Sexuality, that's for sure. I understand it one way and then another way. It's bad enough to weary men. If you weary God, then the virgin will give birth. That's a knee slapper.",
